            <div class="profile-layout"><section class="profile-card"><div class="profile-card-top"><span class="profile-avatar-large">AK</span><div><h2>近藤 葵</h2><p>aoi.kondo@example.com</p><span class="view-badge">Atlas運営</span></div></div><div class="profile-discord"><div><span class="panel-kicker">外部サービス連携</span><strong>Discord</strong><small>運営サーバーと連携済み</small></div><button class="quiet-action" type="button" data-profile-discord>連携を確認</button></div><div class="profile-form-grid"><label>氏名<input value="近藤 葵" data-profile-field="name" /></label><label>所属<input value="Atlasez" data-profile-field="university" /></label><label>学年等<select data-profile-field="year"><option>社会人</option><option>大学生</option><option>大学院生</option></select></label><label>国・地域<input value="日本" data-profile-field="country" /></label></div><label class="profile-bio-field">運営外自己紹介<textarea data-profile-field="bio">学習コンテンツの設計と運営を担当しています。</textarea></label><div class="profile-actions"><span data-profile-message>変更は承認申請として保存されます。</span><button class="modal-primary" type="button" data-profile-save>変更を承認申請</button></div></section><aside class="profile-side"><section class="editor-side-card"><div class="editor-panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">ASSIGNMENTS</span><h2>プロジェクト内の担当</h2></div></div><ul class="profile-assignment-list"><li>アトラス · 数学分野統括</li><li>アトラス · 記事レビュー</li><li>運営事務局 · 進行管理</li></ul></section><section class="editor-side-card"><div class="editor-panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">PRIVATE NOTE</span><h2>個人メモ</h2></div></div><textarea class="profile-private-note" data-profile-note placeholder="自分だけのメモ">次は群作用の記事の具体例を追加する。</textarea><button class="quiet-action" type="button" data-profile-note-save>個人メモを保存</button></section></aside></div>
          </section>

          <section class="prototype-view hub-view" data-view="introductions" aria-labelledby="introductions-heading" hidden>
            <div class="page-heading"><div><p>メンバー</p><h1 id="introductions-heading">運営内自己紹介</h1></div><button class="modal-primary" type="button" data-introduction-edit>自分の自己紹介を変更</button></div>
            <div class="prototype-toolbar"><label class="inline-search">名前・所属・担当で検索<input type="search" placeholder="例：数学、東京大学" data-introduction-search /></label><span class="view-badge" data-introduction-count>4人</span></div>
            <div class="introduction-grid">{introductionEntries.map((person, index) => <article class="introduction-prototype-card" data-introduction-card data-introduction-text={`${person.name} ${person.affiliation} ${person.assignments}`}><div class="introduction-card-head"><span class="profile-avatar-small">{person.name.slice(0, 1)}</span><div><strong>{person.name}</strong><small>{person.affiliation}</small></div></div><div class="introduction-assignment-tags">{person.assignments.split(" / ").map((tag) => <span>{tag}</span>)}</div><p>{person.bio}</p><button class="quiet-action" type="button" data-introduction-view={index}>詳細を見る →</button></article>)}</div>
          </section>

          <section class="prototype-view hub-view" data-view="applications" aria-labelledby="applications-heading" hidden>
            <div class="page-heading"><div><p>管理 / 参加手続き</p><h1 id="applications-heading">応募管理</h1></div><button class="quiet-action" type="button" data-application-refresh>一覧を更新</button></div>
