            <section class="management-role-panel"><div class="section-title"><h2>運営ロールの状態</h2><button type="button" data-management-audit>運用事前チェック</button></div><div class="management-role-grid"><div><b>3</b><span>参加者</span></div><div><b>2</b><span>Discord連携済み</span></div><div><b>4</b><span>担当分野</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>承認待ち</span></div></div></section>
          </section>

          <section class="prototype-view hub-view" data-view="guide" aria-labelledby="guide-heading" hidden>
